1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:06,330
Every evening, in millions of kitchens,
the same question… what's for dinner?

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:11,750
This is Sous, a zero-waste kitchen agent
for Alexa+.

3
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:16,182
Up to 40% of America's food is wasted…

4
00:00:16,222 --> 00:00:20,997
and most of it dies quietly, in our own
fridges.

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:27,372
So we ask… Alexa, what should we cook
tonight?

6
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,632
Sous ranks recipes by the expiring food
they rescue.

7
00:00:31,672 --> 00:00:36,900
Peanut noodles never appear. Leo's
allergic, so it's blocked in code.

8
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:45,440
What's about to expire? The pantry, sorted
by urgency… $23 of food at risk.

9
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:50,430
Tell it once that Ava doesn't like
mushrooms…

10
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:53,887
and Sous remembers it, for every meal.

11
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:58,450
A bigger ask: plan dinners for the next
three nights.

12
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:05,597
One sentence, three MCP tool calls…
suggest, save the plan, build the cart.

13
00:01:05,637 --> 00:01:08,150
All in the live trace.

14
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:11,827
Nothing is bought until I say yes.

15
00:01:11,867 --> 00:01:17,095
One-time cart token, so the order goes
through exactly once.

16
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:24,185
Now we cook, hands-free. Every step, big
enough to read across the room.

17
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:32,882
When a step needs time, Sous offers a
timer… I just say yes.

18
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:37,982
My hands are busy, so I tap Next instead…

19
00:01:38,022 --> 00:01:42,797
voice and touch call the same MCP tools.

20
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:48,170
Every step stays on screen, ingredients
ticked off.

21
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:54,832
Dinner's ready. Sous logged $6.79 of food,
saved from the bin.

22
00:01:55,700 --> 00:02:00,082
Out of ideas? Sous can improvise with
Amazon Bedrock…

23
00:02:00,122 --> 00:02:03,540
and the allergen guard checks every idea.

24
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:13,145
$22 rescued this week, 9 kg of CO₂… over
$1,000 a year.

25
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,672
Now, a brand-new session. New
conversation… same household.

26
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:22,832
Sous still knows Leo's peanut allergy, and
Ava's mushrooms.

27
00:02:22,872 --> 00:02:25,385
That's real memory, across sessions.

28
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:30,872
Sous. Less waste… better dinners. Built
for Alexa+.

